  "admission_unenforced": {
    "wan_ti2v": "admission NOT enforced as qualified: the STATIC path (compute_real_frame_budget -> MotionBudgetError) does fire on this lane, but it uses a row its own comment disqualifies, and the coverage-plan path is inert because QUALIFIED_COST_ROWS is empty. Recalibration + qualification ship together in lane 5.",
